										<p>{formatHours(game.playtime_forever)}</p>
										{game.playtime_2weeks > 0 && (
											<span>近两周 {formatHours(game.playtime_2weeks)}</span>
										)}
									</div>
								</div>
								<div class="steam-card-meta">
									<span>{getLastPlayedText(game.rtime_last_played)}</span>
									<Icon name="material-symbols:open-in-new" class="text-[1rem]" />
								</div>
							</a>
						))}
					</div>
				</>
			) : (
				<div class="text-center py-16">
					<div class="inline-flex items-center justify-center w-16 h-16 bg-(--btn-regular-bg) rounded-full mb-6 border border-(--line-divider)">
						<Icon name={fetchStatus === "failed" ? "material-symbols:error-outline" : "material-symbols:settings"} class="text-[2rem] text-(--btn-content)" />
					</div>
					<h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-black/80 dark:text-white/80 mb-3">
						{fetchStatus === "missing_key"
							? "未配置 STEAM_API_KEY"
							: fetchStatus === "missing_config"
								? "未配置 Steam ID"
								: fetchStatus === "empty"
									? "暂无 Steam 数据"
									: "Steam 数据获取失败"}
					</h2>
					<p class="text-black/60 dark:text-white/60 mb-4 max-w-lg mx-auto">
						{fetchStatus === "missing_key"
							? "请在部署环境中添加 STEAM_API_KEY。密钥只会在构建时用于服务端请求，不会输出到前端。"
							: fetchStatus === "missing_config"
								? "请在 src/config/siteConfig.ts 中配置 steam.steamId。"
								: fetchStatus === "empty"
									? "可能是 Steam 个人资料或游戏库隐私设置限制了 API 读取。"
									: "可能是网络、Steam API 限制或隐私设置导致。页面会在下次构建时重新尝试。"}
					</p>
				</div>
			)}
		</div>
	</div>
</MainGridLayout>

<script>
	function initSteamFilters() {
		const buttons = document.querySelectorAll<HTMLButtonElement>("[data-steam-filter]");
		const games = document.querySelectorAll<HTMLElement>("[data-steam-game]");

		buttons.forEach((button) => {
			button.addEventListener("click", () => {
				const filter = button.dataset.steamFilter || "all";

				buttons.forEach((item) => {
					item.classList.remove("bg-(--primary)", "text-white", "shadow-md");
					item.classList.add("bg-(--btn-regular-bg)", "text-(--btn-content)", "hover:bg-(--btn-regular-bg-hover)");
				});
				button.classList.remove("bg-(--btn-regular-bg)", "text-(--btn-content)", "hover:bg-(--btn-regular-bg-hover)");
				button.classList.add("bg-(--primary)", "text-white", "shadow-md");

				games.forEach((game) => {
					const shouldShow =
						filter === "all" ||
						(filter === "recent" && game.dataset.recent === "true") ||
						(filter === "unplayed" && game.dataset.unplayed === "true");
					game.hidden = !shouldShow;
				});
			});
		});
	}

	function getSteamCoverUrls(image: HTMLImageElement) {
		try {
			const urls = JSON.parse(image.dataset.steamCoverUrls || "[]");
			if (!Array.isArray(urls)) return [];
			return urls.filter((url): url is string => typeof url === "string" && url.length > 0);
		} catch {
			return [];
		}
	}

	function loadNextSteamCover(image: HTMLImageElement) {
		const urls = getSteamCoverUrls(image);
		const currentIndex = Number.parseInt(image.dataset.steamCoverIndex || "0", 10);
		const nextIndex = currentIndex + 1;

		if (nextIndex < urls.length) {
			image.dataset.steamCoverIndex = String(nextIndex);
			image.hidden = false;
			image.src = urls[nextIndex];
			return;
		}

		image.hidden = true;
		image.closest(".steam-cover")?.classList.add("steam-cover-missing");
	}

	function initSteamCoverFallbacks() {
		const images = document.querySelectorAll<HTMLImageElement>("[data-steam-cover-urls]");

		images.forEach((image) => {
			image.addEventListener("error", () => loadNextSteamCover(image));
			if (image.complete && image.naturalWidth === 0) {
				loadNextSteamCover(image);
			}
		});
	}

	function initSteamTrendTabs() {
		const tabs = document.querySelectorAll<HTMLButtonElement>("[data-steam-chart-tab]");
		const panels = document.querySelectorAll<HTMLElement>("[data-steam-chart-panel]");

		tabs.forEach((tab) => {
			tab.addEventListener("click", () => {
				const range = tab.dataset.steamChartTab;

				tabs.forEach((item) => {
					const isActive = item.dataset.steamChartTab === range;
					item.classList.toggle("is-active", isActive);
					item.setAttribute("aria-pressed", isActive ? "true" : "false");
				});

				panels.forEach((panel) => {
					panel.hidden = panel.dataset.steamChartPanel !== range;
				});
			});
		});
	}

	function initSteamPage() {
		initSteamFilters();
		initSteamCoverFallbacks();
		initSteamTrendTabs();
	}

	if (document.readyState === "loading") {
		document.addEventListener("DOMContentLoaded", initSteamPage);
	} else {
		initSteamPage();
	}
</script>

